    "title": "Trump says Scott Bessent won't be AI czar - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dan Mangan @in/danmangancnbc/ @_DanMangan ,\n1 days ago President Donald Trump said Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent will not be his artificial intelligence czar. Trump’s announcement came after Semafor and Reuters reported he was considering Bessent for the post. “Scott Bessent will not be going to be Super Intelligence (SI) Czar,” Trump wrote in a Truth Social post.... Read full article",
